    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d608-a1">

                <pb facs="0619" n="585" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg585"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 1267.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Stamford Manufacturing
                            Company to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Alexandretta</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-23"><hi rendition="#italic">April 23,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Our agents at Adalia and Lattakia ordered to leave, leaving American property in
                    transit to coast unprotected. If nothing can be done for protection please hold
                    Government responsible for all loss.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stamford.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
